  "question": {
    "text": "A ray of light travelling in water is incident on a glass plate immersed in it. When the angle of incidence is <math><msup><mrow><mn>51</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup></math>, the reflected ray is totally polarized. Find out the refractive index of glass.<br />\r<br />\r[The refractive index of water is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>tan</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mn>51</mn><mi>o</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>235</mn></math>]"
  },
